(j)
"Land" means agricultural land whether alienated or un-alienated; and includes land used for purposes subservient to
agriculture and all benefits arising out of such land and things thereon attached to the earth, or permanently fastened to
anything attached to the earth;
(k)
"Land Revenue Act" means [the Telangana Land Revenue Act, 1317 F.]
[Adapted in G.O.Ms.No.46, Law (F) Department, dated 01.06.2016.]
;
(l)
"Lease" includes the counterpart of a lease and a sub-lease;
(m)
"Local area" means an area specified as such in a notification issued under section 3;
(n)
"Person" includes an undivided Hindu Family;
(o)
[ "permanent alienation" includes any sale, exchange or gift and any transfer of a right of occupancy or of the patta of a
holding but does not include any disposition by will]
[Amended by Act No.XXIII of 1951.]
;
(p)
"prescribed" means prescribed by rules made under this Act;
(q)
[ omitted]
[Clause (q) omitted by Act No.III of 1954.]
;
(r)
[ "Protected tenant" means a person who is deemed to be a protected tenant under the provisions of this Act]
[Clause (r) substituted by Act No.15 of 1971.]
;
(s)
"Reasonable rent" means the rent determined under section 17;
(t)
"Rent" means any consideration, in money or kind or both, paid or payable by a tenant on account of the use or
occupation of the land held by him but does not include the rendering of any personal service or labour;
(u)
"Tenancy" means the relationship of land holder and tenant;
